  </nav>
  <h1 class="text-2xl text-navy leading-tight">Cabo Sailing &amp; Shared Snorkeling</h1>
  <p class="text-slate-700 text-base leading-relaxed mt-2">A small-group sailing adventure to Cabo's iconic Arch and Pelican Rock &mdash; never more than 14 guests onboard.</p>
</div>

<!-- MOBILE: Icons row -->
<div class="lg:hidden mt-5 px-5">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-3 gap-y-3">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-gold text-lg">schedule</span>
