  <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-base">Join our popular shared snorkeling tour and discover the magic of Cabo San Lucas alongside fellow adventurers. Visit the famous Arch, snorkel alongside tropical fish at Pelican Rock, and enjoy a refreshing open bar and lunch onboard &mdash; all at an unbeatable price.</p>

  <div class="mt-7 faq-item border border-border-light rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
    <input class="hidden" id="mobile-itinerary" type="checkbox"/>
    <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer" for="mobile-itinerary">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-1 h-5 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
